# === Knowledge base — TRACKED ===
# kb/ is funnel stage 2-3 (see AGENTS.md): kb/raw/ is immutable source material and
# kb/ layer-2 pages ground every PRD. Both must be versioned — unused material is
# archived to kb/_archive/, never deleted, never ignored. Do not add kb/ ignores here.

